{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/features/layout,_N_T_/features/page,_N_T_/features"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/features/__PAGE__","/features","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"ja\" class=\"dark bg-background noto_sans_jp_3543ebd4-module__w_C4Pa__variable geist_mono_d6617093-module__z61v7q__variable\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.08e28id.o-okb.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ad9c66e761fed85a-s.p.0e4b2z5rxsmxh.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0u_tt1m0yddpe.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0-_s.-vt0r3x4.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0pqt~8bl3ukh4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/10u3y4bw1ayzs.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0c7h~x4_chf35.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-0iqf54kqu1sz2.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0iwz~d34oj_si.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0d3shmwh5_nmn.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0s7e_195_1~m9.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"white\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0b0e14\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/><meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"dark light\"/><title>特徴 | Zive Browser</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Zive Browserの特徴。軽量で高速、オープンソースをベースにしたカスタムブラウザ。\"/><meta name=\"generator\" content=\"v0.app\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon-light-32x32.png\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon-dark-32x32.png\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon.png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"flex min-h-screen flex-col\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-border/60 bg-background/80 backdrop-blur-md\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-16 max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-4 sm:px-6\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" aria-label=\"Zive Browser ホーム\" href=\"/\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"https://zive-image.pages.dev/1.png\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-7 w-7 text-primary\"><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0.35\"></circle><path d=\"M17.5 6 9 18h6l-.5 8L23 14h-6l.5-8Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight\">Zive Browser</span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-8 md:flex\" aria-label=\"メインナビゲーション\"><a class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/features\">特徴</a><a class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/download\">ダウンロード</a><a class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/about\">Ziveとは</a><a class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/notes\">開発記録</a><a href=\"https://note.com/zive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\">note</a><a href=\"https://github.com/Zive-Team/ZiveBrowser\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\">GitHub</a></nav></div></header><main class=\"flex-1 pt-8\"><section id=\"features\" class=\"border-t border-border/60 py-20 sm:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-balance text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl\">ミニマルだから、速い。</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-pretty text-muted-foreground\">Zive Browser は「使うものだけ」を丁寧に磨き込んだブラウザです。</p></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gauge h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 14 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-lg font-medium\">広告ブロックなしで高速表示</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">通信フィルターを排除し、コンテンツをそのまま、ありのままに高速表示。余計な処理を挟まないから軽快です。</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-house h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\"></path><path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-6a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 6A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-lg font-medium\">自作ホームページ</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">起動時や新規タブを開いたときに、内蔵の独自ホームページを表示。ライト / ダークモードの両方に対応しています。</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-lg font-medium\">最新のChromiumベース</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Electron のアップデートにより、最新の Web セキュリティと規格に追従。安心して最新のサイトを閲覧できます。</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-primary/40\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-box h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z\"></path><path d=\"m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-lg font-medium\">独自ブランドの軽量設計</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">コード内のすべての表記を刷新した、完全スタンドアロンなブラウザ。不要な機能を削ぎ落として軽量化しました。</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-border/60 py-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-6 px-4 sm:flex-row sm:px-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center g